{"license":"DANS Licence","fileAccessRequest":true,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Historia & Informatica, Nieuwsbrief"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:50714"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"NHDA"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"NIWI-KNAW"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Data Station Admin"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Gearchiveerde nummers in pdf van de nieuwsbrief Historia & Informatica.<\/p><p>Het blad H&I verscheen op initiatief van het Nederlands Historisch Data Archief (NHDA, later NHDA\/NIWI), de Vereniging voor Geschiedenis en Informatica (VGI) en het Internationaal Instituut voor Sociale Geschiedenis (IISG). Aanvankelijk een papieren editie (jaargangen 1 t\/m 7), was de nieuwsbrief vanaf de aflevering 7-3 ook via een webapplicatie raadpleegbaar. Historia & Informatica hield na 12 jaargangen in december 2005 op te bestaan.<\/p><p>De opvolger van H&I, de nieuwsbrief 'e-data&research', verschijnt sinds juni 2006.<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass"